# K03 (Codex -07 Q2): ordinary data keeps forward visibility -- b, declared below the statement that reads it, is no
# name there (the author, LMX_blog 2026-09-22: a non-callable is visible after its declaration).  Refused at b.
int: a b + 1
int: b 3
fn: m () int
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
